+Answers a `list_sessions` request with a page of conversation summaries.
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "session_list",
+  "sessions": [
+    {
+      "sessionId": "550e8400-...",
+      "createdAt": "2026-01-15T14:30:00Z",
+      "updatedAt": "2026-01-15T14:35:00Z",
+      "entryCount": 5
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+| Field      | Type   | Description                                           |
+| ---------- | ------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`     | string | `"session_list"`                                      |
+| `sessions` | array  | Array of conversation summaries (SessionSummaryFrame) |
+
+Each summary in `sessions` carries:
+
+| Field        | Type   | Description                          |
+| ------------ | ------ | ------------------------------------ |
+| `sessionId`  | string | Unique session identifier            |
+| `createdAt`  | string | ISO 8601 creation time               |
+| `updatedAt`  | string | ISO 8601 last activity time          |
+| `entryCount` | number | Count of entries in the conversation |
+
+The list is newest-activity first. When the store supports it, `sessions` carries at most `limit` summaries (default 50, max 200). A store that implements no listing (or one that throws `StoreCannotList`) returns `UNSUPPORTED` ([validated by: answers UNSUPPORTED when the store has no listFor, and SERVER_ERROR with a ws error log when listFor throws](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L121), [validated by: answers list_sessions with formatted summaries when listFor succeeds](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L165), [validated by: answers list_sessions with error UNSUPPORTED when history is disabled, even if the store has listFor](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L127), [validated by: answers list_sessions with error UNSUPPORTED when no store is provided](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L136), [validated by: answers list_sessions with error UNSUPPORTED when the store implements no listFor](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L144), [validated by: answers list_sessions with error UNSUPPORTED when listFor throws StoreCannotList](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L152), [validated by: answers SERVER_ERROR and logs the session id when listFor throws](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L180)).
